Gumroad/Fiverr/PayPal under brand with marketplace KYC. Pc Technic = technical projects, not product CTA. Plant repos = no public dump. Brand 9:16 shorts: `brand-short-video` + `config/short_video_jobs.json` only; free media (owned stills, Pixabay/Unsplash free keys, edge-tts/gTTS/SAPI, YAL/NCS with credit); never auto-publish TikTok/IG/YouTube; never plant HMI.

Casino STOP: `docs/knowledge/decisions/2026-09-04_no-unlicensed-solana-casino.md`  
